100 REM Dithered Dot Option 30 Bitmap Viewer - 20Feb2023 mcm110 REM each INPUT contains up to 1024 dots in X,Y pairs120 REM Z array is used for RMOVE/RDRAW to create each Opt 30 dot140 REM then the Opt 30 dot object is FIXed150 REM last INPUT contains 0 to stop the viewer160 INIT 170 BRIGHTNESS 1190 PRINT "Dithered Option 30 Bitmap ViewerInput Bitmap file#: ";200 INPUT F210 FIND @5:F220 PAGE 230 INPUT@5:V240 IF V=0 THEN 410245 DEL Z250 DIM Z(2*V)260 INPUT@5:Z270 ROPEN 1280 VISIBILITY 1,0290 REM move to starting point and draw first dot300 MOVE Z(1),Z(2)310 RMOVE 0,0320 RDRAW 0,0330 REM now draw rest of dots on this line340 FOR I=3 TO 2*V STEP 2350 RMOVE Z(I),0360 RDRAW 0,0370 NEXT I380 RCLOSE 390 FIX 1400 GO TO 230410 HOME 420 END 